'''''Vincebus Eruptum''''' is a [[psychedelic music|psychedelic]] album by proto-[[heavy metal music|heavy metal]] band [[Blue Cheer]], released in January of [[1968]] (see [[1968 in music]]).

''Vincebus Eruptum'' peaked at #11 on [[Billboard Music Charts|Billboard]]'s Pop Albums chart (North America), while the single, a cover of [[Eddie Cochran]]'s &quot;Summertime Blues&quot;, peaked at #14 on the Pop Singles chart.

