        <username>Sgt Pinback</username>
        <id>596014</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Frankenshred''' is a [[Heavy metal music|heavy metal]] band based in [[Phoenix, Arizona]], [[United States]].

Started in [[1996]] by [[Dr. Frankenshred]], [[World War Spencer]] and [[Kelly Knight]], the band has steadfastly grown into a well known band outside of Phoenix. In [[1997]], they released their first demo, which was self titled.

In [[2001]], the band signed up with [[Diginet Music]], a company led by [[David T. Chastain]].

==Discography==
*''[[Frankenshred (demo)|Frankenshred]]'' (1997)
*''[[Evil Shred]]'' ([[1999]], for ''[[Evil Shred Productions]]'')
*''[[Diginet Guitar Masters Seriess]]'' ([[2001]])
*''[[Guitar Avengers 2]]'' (2001)
*''[[Guitarmaggedon]]'' (2001)
*''[[Angry Minds]]'' (2001)

==External link==
*[http://www.frankenshred.galaxyhit.com/Frankenshred.html Frankenshred home page]

[[Category:American musical groups]]</text>
