* [http://news.bbc.co.uk/1/hi/world/middle_east/2730253.stm Zarqawi and the 'al-Qaeda link' ], February 5, 2003.
* [http://www.aftenposten.no/english/local/article513564.ece Mullah Krekar arrested] ( [http://web.archive.org/web/20041110052354/www.aftenposten.no/english/local/article513564.ece mirrored version] ), March 21, 2003.
* [http://news.bbc.co.uk/1/hi/world/middle_east/2875269.stm US targets Islamist group in Iraq], March 22, 2003.
