* [http://globetrotter.berkeley.edu/people/Searle/searle-con5.html John Searle account] of FSM; [http://ist-socrates.berkeley.edu/~jsearle/Free%20Speech%20Movement-1.htm some photos] on [[John Searle]]'s site.
