      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Mickey Joe Harte''' (born [[1973]]) is a professional singer-songwriter from [[Lifford]], [[County Donegal]], [[Ireland]]. He was chosen to represent Ireland in the 2003 [[Eurovision Song Contest]] with &quot;We've Got The World&quot;. He won this through telephone votes by viewers of the [[Radio Telifís Éireann]] reality show, &quot;You're A Star&quot;, which set records for Irish TV ratings over the period of [[November]] [[2002]] to [[March]] [[2003]]. 

&quot;We've Got The World&quot; topped the Irish billboard singles chart.

==Other You're A Star Winners==
*[[Chris Doran]]
*[[Donna and Joseph McCaul]]

