: [[Persian Gulf War]]
: [[Tigris-Euphrates alluvial salt marsh]]

[[Category:Palearctic]]
[[Category:Deserts and xeric shrublands]]

[[ar:الصحراء العربية]]
[[et:Araabia kõrb]]</text>
