  Prev  = [[Édouard Hervé]]|
  Next  = [[Auguste Jonnart]]
}}

[[Category:1856 births|Deschanel, Paul]]
[[Category:1922 deaths|Deschanel, Paul]]
[[Category:Members of the Académie française|Deschanel, Paul]]
