'''''Green Onions''''' is a [[soul music|soul]] album by [[Booker T. &amp; the M.G.'s]], released on [[Stax Records]] in October of [[1962]] (see [[1962 in music]]).

''Green Onions'' peaked at #33 on [[Billboard Music Charts|Billboard]]'s (North America) Pop Albums chart.

