'''''Stretchin' Out in Bootsy's Rubber Band''''' is a [[funk]] album by [[Bootsy Collins]], released in April of [[1976]] (see [[1976 in music]]).  Collins had just left [[George Clinton (funk musician)|George Clinton]]'s [[P-Funk]] collective for a solo career, and the album became a popular success.

==Track listing==
