The '''Turkmen SSR''' was a [[Republics of the Soviet Union|constituent republic]] of the [[Soviet Union]] until [[1991]] when it declared independence as [[Turkmenistan]]. It was initially established on [[August 7]] [[1921]] as ''Turkmen Oblast'' of the [[Turkestan ASSR]]. On [[May 13]] [[1925]] it was transformed into ''Turkmen SSR'' and became a separate republic of the [[USSR]]. On [[October 27]] [[1991]] it was renamed into ''Republic of [[Turkmenistan]]''.

==See also==
* [[Communist Party of the Turkmen SSR]]

